{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["猶大王約坦、亞哈斯和希西迦執政期間，耶和華把祂的話傳給了摩利沙人彌迦。他看到了有關撒瑪利亞和耶路撒冷的異象。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["審判將臨"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"萬民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都要聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地和地上的萬物啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要側耳傾聽！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華從祂的聖殿裡作證指控你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和華離開祂的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從天降臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"腳踏大地的高處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山在祂腳下熔化，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如火中的蠟；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山谷崩裂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巖石如水沿山坡傾瀉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這一切都是因為雅各的叛逆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家的罪惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的叛逆在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不是在撒瑪利亞嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大的邱壇在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"豈不是在耶路撒冷嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「所以，耶和華說：我要使撒瑪利亞淪為荒野的廢墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為栽種葡萄園的地方。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把她的石頭拋進山谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"露出她的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所有的神像都要被打碎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所得的嫖資都要化為灰燼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毀滅她的一切偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她以嫖資得來的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也要被用作妓女的嫖資。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["先知的哀傷"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"為此，我要痛哭哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要赤身光腳行走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像豺狼哀嚎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如鴕鳥悲鳴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為撒瑪利亞的創傷無法救治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已經禍及猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直逼我百姓的城門，直逼耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在迦特宣揚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"千萬不要哭泣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在伯·亞弗拉的灰塵中打滾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沙斐的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們將滿面羞辱地赤身流亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒南的居民不敢出城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯·以薛在痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們已失去它的庇護。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪律的居民痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴望得到拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華已把災難降到耶路撒冷的城門。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拉吉的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用駿馬套車逃命吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你們首先唆使少女錫安犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你們身上看到了以色列的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去向摩利設·迦特贈送告別禮物吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞革悉人必令以色列諸王受騙上當。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪利沙的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使征服者到你們那裡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的領袖","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"要躲到亞杜蘭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"猶大人啊，你們要剃光頭髮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你們所愛的兒女悲傷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要剃得如禿鷹一樣光禿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們要被擄到遠方。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「以色列的領袖」希伯來文是「以色列的榮耀」。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}